          "date": "2026-11-03 18:27:50.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "patrick bot",
          "email": "patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us",
          "date": "2026-11-04 06:16:47.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20076 tests: stop a target with one remote command",
        "message": "LU-20076 tests: stop a target with one remote command\n\nStopping a target cost three remote commands: a check that\nit is mounted, the umount, and the wait for devices in the\nST state, which polls with one more command each time. A\nZFS target adds the pool export, and where the dm-flakey\ndevice is removed (a failover pair, CLEANUP_DM_DEV, or a\nsecond file system) the check and the removal add six.\n\nRun all of this as one remote script. The wait for the ST\ndevices runs on the server, with the same intervals and\nlimit, and wait_exit_ST() also uses that script. Return\ncodes and messages are the same as before, but they are\nprinted when the script ends rather than as it runs, so the\nprogress of a long wait shows only at its end.\n\nMeasured on a cluster of one MDS with 4 MDTs, one OSS with 6\nOSTs and 2 clients, median of 3 to 6 runs, as is and with\n0.25 s added to each remote command:\n\n                cmds       as is           +0.25 s\n  stop ost1    3 -> 1   0.29 -> 0.12 s  1.00 -> 0.35 s\n  stop mds2    3 -> 1   0.34 -> 0.23 s  1.09 -> 0.47 s\n  stopall     34 -> 14  22.5 -> 21.3 s  23.9 -> 23.5 s\n\nstopall's time is mostly an umount wait in the kernel. CI\nstops about 8.5 million targets in 30 days; two fewer\ncommands of 0.2 to 0.35 s each, counting a parallel stop as\nhalf, is roughly 430 to 1240 hours of test time, more on\nconfigurations with failover partners.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity,replay-single\nTest-Parameters: trivial fstype=zfs testlist=conf-sanity\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=insanity,recovery-small\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I4d848dd48f029be2ebc13b97f9537b829ffa334a\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
